  "content": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mwstitle section\">\n\n    <h1 property=\"name\" class=\"wb-inv\" id=\"wb-cont\" dir=\"ltr\">\nBusiness and industry</h1>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n      <h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\">Business and industry</h1>\n      <p>Business taxes, financing, permits and  regulations, intellectual property, business support and how to sell to  government.</p>\n    </div>\n     \n  </div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"well well-sm provisional gc-most-requested\"><div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-2\">\n        <h2>Most requested</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-10\">\n        <ul class=\"colcount-md-2\"><li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/department-finance/programs/international-trade-finance-policy/canadas-response-us-tariffs.html\">Canada's response to U.S. tariffs on Canadian goods</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.ic.gc.ca/app/scr/cc/CorporationsCanada/fdrlCrpSrch.html?locale=en_CA\">Find a corporation</a> </li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/corporations-canada/en/keep-your-corporation-good-shape/annual-return\">File Corporations Canada annual return</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/digital-services-businesses/business-account.html\">My Business Account (Canada Revenue Agency)</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/canada-small-business-financing-program/en\">Helping small businesses get loans</a> </li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.bdc.ca/en/financing/small-business-loan\">Loans to improve cash flow and increase sales</a></li>\n        </ul></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section><div class=\"container\">\n  <section class=\"gc-srvinfo\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2>\n    <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/start.html\">Starting a business</a></h3>\n        <p>Business planning, naming a business, registering with the government, getting support and financing</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/taxes.html\">Business taxes</a></h3>\n        <p>Income tax, GST/HST, payroll and T4 information returns, business numbers, customs duties and tariffs</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"https://innovation.ised-isde.canada.ca/s/?language=en_CA\">Business financing and support</a></h3>\n        <p>Grants and contributions, loans, tax credits, wage subsidies and other business support</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/corporations-canada/en\">Federal corporations</a></h3>\n        <p>Incorporating or making changes to a business corporation, not-for-profit, cooperative or board of trade</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/maintaingrowimprovebusiness.html\">Maintaining your business</a></h3>\n        <p>Managing your business operations, strategic and financial planning, marketing, social responsibility</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/permits.html\">Permits, licences and regulations</a></h3>\n        <p>Search permits and licences, find regulations for your industry and business activities</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/hire.html\">Hiring and managing employees</a></h3>\n        <p>Payroll, wages and other resources for recruiting, training and managing employees</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"https://international.canada.ca/en/services/business/trade\">International trade and investment</a></h3>\n        <p>Exporting, importing and investing in Canada and foreign markets</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/ip.html\">Intellectual property and copyright</a></h3>\n        <p>Trademarks, patents, copyright, industrial designs and protecting your intellectual property</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/research.html\">Research and business intelligence</a></h3>\n        <p>Industry sector data, financial benchmarks, labour trends and business statistics</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/doing-business.html\">Doing business with the government</a></h3>\n        <p>Selling to the federal government, buying from the government, selling to other governments</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/science/innovation.html\">R&amp;D and innovation</a></h3>\n        <p>Funding, collaboration, commercialization and licensing resources to help fuel innovation</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"/en/services/business/protecting.html\">Protecting your business</a></h3>\n        <p>Emergency planning, risk management, insurance, legal issues, security and privacy, fraud</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <h3><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/office-superintendent-bankruptcy/en/you-owe-money\">Insolvency for business</a></h3>\n        <p>Options for dealing with debt, making a proposal to creditors, filing for bankruptcy</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section><div class=\"row mrgn-tp-xl\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n      <section class=\"gc-features\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Features</h2>\n        <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n            <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-4\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/themes/business/features/affected-tariffs-b.png\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/department-finance/programs/international-trade-finance-policy/canadas-response-us-tariffs/support-canadian-workers-employers.html?utm_campaign=not-applicable&amp;utm_medium=vanity-url&amp;utm_source=canada-ca_support-tariff&amp;utm_source=canada&amp;utm_medium=promofeature&amp;utm_campaign=esdc-edsc-support-canadian-workers-employers-25-26&amp;utm_content=static_0001\" class=\"stretched-link\">Help for those affected by tariffs</a></h3>\n              <p>Learn more about financial supports and more.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n            <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-5\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/themes/business/features/SFB_Promo.png\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/ised/en/supports-business?utm_campaign=ised-isde-sfb-23-24&amp;utm_medium=pog&amp;utm_source=gov-dep&amp;utm_content=web-button-en-231101\" class=\"stretched-link\"> Supports for business</a></h3>\n              <p>Solutions to your business challenges rights at your fingertip.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\"> \n      <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-6\"> \n       <img src=\"/content/dam/themes/business/features/26-0121_d---gcsurplus-organic-campaign_web---360x203px.png\" alt=\"Different categories of goods displayed on a green background: a desk with a lamp, chair and laptop, a sports car, a boat, a drill, a watch and two mobile devices.\"><h3><a href=\"https://gcsurplus.ca/mn-eng.cfm?utm_campaign=pspc-spac-gcsurplus-25-26&amp;utm_medium=vanity-url&amp;utm_source=canada-ca_bus&amp;ind_en\">Canada’s government surplus marketplace</a></h3> \n\t\t  <p>Shop GCSurplus for affordable government surplus items (furniture, vehicles and more) and support sustainability nationwide.</p>\n      </div> \n\t\t\t</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n            <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-7\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/themes/finance/features/1079_08_25CASLAdvertisingCampaign_Web.png\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/canada-anti-spam-legislation/en/hung-mobile-spam\" class=\"stretched-link\">Beware of suspicious messages, report them!</a></h3>\n<p>Learn how to recognize suspicious text messages and report them safely to help protect yourself.</p>\n              \n            </div></div>\n           \n           \n          \n           \n          \n           \n          \n       \n\t\t  </div>\n\t\t</section></div>\n\t</div>\n\n      <section class=\"provisional gc-followus\"><h2>On social media</h2>\n        <ul class=\"list-inline\"><li> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/EntreprisesCanada\" class=\"facebook wb-lbx wb-init wb-lbx-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-8\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Facebook : </span>EntreprisesCanada</a> </li>\n          <li> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/EntreprisesCan\" rel=\"external\" class=\"twitter\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Twitter : </span>@EntreprisesCan</a> </li>\n          <li> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/entreprisescdn/\" rel=\"external\" class=\"instagram\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Instagram : </span>entreprisescdn</a> </li>\n        </ul></section><section class=\"provisional gc-contributors\"><h2>From:</h2>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/ised/en\">Innovation, Science and Economic Development Canada</a></li>\n    </ul></section></div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>"
